flowchart TD
  Start[rubixdb cli or gui] --> Resolve[Resolve instance name and path]
  Resolve --> Lock{Acquire OS instance lock}
  Lock -->|owned| Bind[Bind persisted or default API port]
  Lock -->|already held| Handshake[HTTP identity handshake]
  Handshake -->|verified| Attach[Attach to running instance]
  Handshake -->|unverifiable| Stop[Report locked-but-unverifiable]
  Bind --> Manifest[Load or persist manifest]
  Manifest --> Credentials[Load or generate credentials]
  Credentials --> Host[Start embedded API host]
  Host --> Recover[Open storage and recover WAL/SSTables]
  Recover --> Ready[Serve authenticated API and optional frontend]
  Attach --> Ready
